    "body": "S006 replaces scalar leaf balances and unrooted boundary assumptions with exact rooted interfaces: binary clearing trees, nonempty stacking forests, three positive-source residue minima and a separate zero-source case. Complete proofs give pure-pile minimum certificates, arbitrary fixed-buffer interfaces, constructive finiteness, a coarse rooted bound and an exact AS-ray last-loser formula. The general-versus-binary extremal comparison remains unproved, so universal ASH* stays OPEN for both goals.\n\nIndependent certificate checkers replay 2,145 clearing trees and 367 stacking forests and check all production/concatenation inequalities. Separate full forward/reverse algorithms agree on 3,155,536 labelled configurations in 531 layers, with an explicit state cutoff after mass 29 on the length-three tail. Complete auxiliary closures refute the scalar attachment rule in both directions. The inherited finite frontiers and source credits remain intact; canonical LF evidence checkout is now enforced across Windows and hosted runs.\n\nState/spec/source/claim mirrors and every session/gate/decision/failure/search/campaign ledger are updated. The complete S007 handoff is FUTURE/UNEXECUTED. No novelty-stage promotion, Lean, contact or submission. This PR contains one atomic authored S006 commit; integration pins and actual hosted jobs are recorded below after they exist.\n\nVerified immutable head and pre-merge evidence:\n\n- Base/sole authored parent: `876e2a36a1fe15c82e3f7085c233f3f9f49ed2d5`.\n- Single S006 authored head: `74feae2559af1ddc855febbd0da9693faf51ef22`; tree `532ef8c7244a345b02a507387168909bc076ad9b`. PR commit list independently contains exactly one commit.\n- All 15 distinct required local checks pass; the earlier stale administrative assertion failure and successful repair are retained. All 59 staged hashes matched canonical Git blobs.\n- Head workflow [38562657615](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38562657615) completed success. Actual jobs:\n  - [validate](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38562657615/job/115847351501): SUCCESS, job `115847351501`.\n  - [s005-replay (2)](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38562657615/job/115847351771): SUCCESS, job `115847351771`.\n  - [s005-replay (0)](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38562657615/job/115847351828): SUCCESS, job `115847351828`.\n  - [s005-replay (3)](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38562657615/job/115847351974): SUCCESS, job `115847351974`.\n  - [s005-replay (1)](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38562657615/job/115847352248): SUCCESS, job `115847352248`.\n- The validate job's S006 grammar/forest/full dual-traversal step completed success. Actual checks were inspected separately from the empty legacy status contexts. Rulesets remain empty; entry protection endpoint returned 404 \"Branch not protected\".\n\nVerified ordinary merge and final main:\n\n- Non-force two-parent merge: `e320a3c80da3807beb031c8b2dab69bfb807805c`; parents exactly `876e2a36a1fe15c82e3f7085c233f3f9f49ed2d5` and `74feae2559af1ddc855febbd0da9693faf51ef22`.\n- Merge tree `532ef8c7244a345b02a507387168909bc076ad9b` equals the tested authored-head tree. GitHub commit/ref, independent remote ref, fetched ref and clean local main agree. Live STATE/NEXT_SESSION_PROMPT contents were independently re-read and match local bytes.\n- Post-merge workflow [38563198626](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38563198626) completed SUCCESS, for merge SHA `e320a3c80da3807beb031c8b2dab69bfb807805c`. Actual jobs:\n  - [validate](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38563198626/job/115849194401): SUCCESS, job `115849194401`.\n  - [s005-replay (2)](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38563198626